4. MEDICAL AND SAFETY DISCLAIMER
   This software is an EDUCATIONAL tool. Its simulations use simplified models,
   and its medical templates are educational prototypes, NOT medical devices.
   They are not clinically validated, calibrated or tested for electrical safety.
   Never connect any circuit designed or simulated with this software to a
   person or patient. Real medical equipment must meet IEC 60601 and the other
   applicable standards and regulations.

